OL,3,GNEWSAThe changing face of the West and
OL,4,Awhat new housing means for the region
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are a number of new housing
OL,7,Fdevelopments either planned or being
OL,8,Fbuilt across the West of England.
OL,10,FMany of them will change the face of
OL,11,Ftowns and cities here amid government
OL,12,Ftargets to build more than a million
OL,13,Fhomes before 2029.
OL,15,FHere, we look at where the biggest ones
OL,16,Fare being built and which of those
OL,17,Fstill planned are causing the most
OL,18,Fcontroversy.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
