OL,3,GNEWSAThe changing face of the West and
OL,4,Awhat new housing means for the region
OL,5,
OL,6,FSalisbury has seen significant
OL,7,Fdevelopment in recent years, with
OL,8,Fhundreds of homes at St Peter's Place
OL,9,Fin the north of the city, plans to
OL,10,Fexpand a 600-home development in
OL,11,FWilton, and hundreds more at Harnham
OL,12,Fand Old Sarum.
